    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">impallesco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inp-</span></b> ), lŭi, 3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. n.</i>
			[in-pallesco], <i>to grow</i> or <i>turn
				pale in</i> or <i>at</i> any thing (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nocturnis chartis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eventu impalluit ipse secundo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 805</span></i>
			.</div>
